{"speciesId":44,"names":{"fr":"Ortide","es":"Gloom","en":"Gloom","ja":"クサイハナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"The fluid that oozes from its mouth isn't drool. It is a nectar that is used to attract prey."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"The fluid that oozes from its mouth isn't drool. It is a nectar that is used to attract prey."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Smells incredibly foul! However, around 1 out of 1,000 people enjoy sniffing its nose- bending stink."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"What appears to be drool is actually sweet honey. It is very sticky and clings stubbornly if touched."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It secretes a sticky, drool-like honey. Although sweet, it smells too repulsive to get very close."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The smell from its drool-like syrup and the pollen on its petals is so bad, it may make opponents faint."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GLOOM releases a foul fragrance from the pistil of its flower. When faced with danger, the stench worsens. If this POKéMON is feeling calm and secure, it does not release its usual stinky aroma."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"From its mouth GLOOM drips honey that smells absolutely horrible. Apparently, it loves the horrid stench. It sniffs the noxious fumes and then drools even more of its honey."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A horribly noxious honey drools from its mouth. One whiff of the honey can result in memory loss. Some fans are said to enjoy this overwhelming stink, however."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its pistils exude an incredibly foul odor. The horrid stench can cause fainting at a distance of 1.25 miles."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The fluid that oozes from its mouth isn’t drool. It is a nectar that is used to attract prey."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"What appears to be drool is actually sweet honey. It is very sticky and clings stubbornly if touched."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It secretes a sticky, drool-like honey. Although sweet, it smells too repulsive to get very close."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"L’odeur du nectar de sa bouche est si répugnante qu’elle agresse les narines à deux kilomètres."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"L’odeur du nectar de sa bouche est si répugnante qu’elle agresse les narines à deux kilomètres."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il sent très mauvais ! Mais une personne sur 1 000 aime la puanteur de son corps nauséabond."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"¡Huele bastante mal! De todas formas, una de cada mil personas aprecian su fétido olor."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Smells incredibly foul! However, around one out of a thousand people enjoy sniffing its nose-bending stink."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"猛烈な クサさ！ それなのに １０００人に １人ぐらい これを 好んで かぐ 人がいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"L’odeur du nectar de sa bouche est si répugnante qu’elle agresse les narines à 2 km."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La miel que emana de su boca posee un hedor capaz de derribar enemigos a 2 km de distancia."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"口から たれている ミツは ２キロ 離れていても 鼻が まがるほど 猛烈に くさい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La plupart du temps, Ortide dégage un parfum immonde du pistil de sa fleur. Lorsqu’il se sent en danger, la puanteur est encore pire. Lorsque ce Pokémon se sent bien et en sécurité, il ne dégage aucune odeur nauséabonde."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Gloom libera un fétido olor por el pistilo de la flor. Cuando está en peligro, el hedor se intensifica. Si este Pokémon está tranquilo y no se siente amenazado, no libera el desagradable olor."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Gloom releases a foul fragrance from the pistil of its flower. When faced with danger, the stench worsens. If this Pokémon is feeling calm and secure, it does not release its usual stinky aroma."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"危険を 感じると めしべの 放つ くさい 臭いが さらに 強まるが 心が 穏やかな ときは くさい 臭いを 出さないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ortide bave un miel qui sent horriblement mauvais. Apparemment, il adore cette odeur nauséabonde. Il en renifle les fumées toxiques et se met à baver du miel de plus belle."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Gloom babea un néctar que tiene un olor realmente horrible, aunque parece ser que a él le gusta. De hecho, aspira los gases nocivos y libera más néctar aún."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"From its mouth Gloom drips honey that smells absolutely horrible. Apparently, it loves the horrid stench. It sniffs the noxious fumes and then drools even more of its honey."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"どうやら クサイハナは 口から 垂らしている 猛烈に 臭い ニオイが 大好き らしい。 ニオイを 嗅いで さらに みつを あふれさせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il sent très mauvais, mais une personne sur mille aime l’odeur de son corps nauséabond."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Huele bastante mal, pero una de cada mil personas aprecia su fétido olor."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Smells incredibly foul! However, around one out of a thousand people enjoy sniffing its nose-bending stink."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"猛烈な クサさ！ それなのに １０００人に １人ぐらい これを 好んで 嗅ぐ人がいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il sent très mauvais, mais une personne sur mille aime l’odeur de son corps nauséabond."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Huele bastante mal, pero una de cada mil personas aprecia su fétido olor."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Smells incredibly foul! However, around one out of a thousand people enjoy sniffing its nose-bending stink."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"猛烈な クサさ！ それなのに １０００人に １人ぐらい これを 好んで 嗅ぐ人がいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses pistils sécrètent une odeur incroyablement fétide qui fait perdre connaissance à ses adversaires jusqu’à 2 km à la ronde."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Libera un fétido olor por los pistilos. El fuerte hedor hace perder el conocimiento a cualquiera que se encuentre en un radio de 2 km."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its pistils exude an incredibly foul odor. The horrid stench can cause fainting at a distance of 1.25 miles."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"めしべが 放つ とてつもなく 臭い においは ２キロ先まで とどき 気を 失わせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce qui semble être sa bave est en fait du nectar très collant. Si on le touche, il est très difficile de s’en dépêtrer."},{"language":"es","version":"s